{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45230","headline":"同明府章送沈秀才还石门山读书 · 皎然","name":"同明府章送沈秀才还石门山读书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身爲郢令客，心许楚山云。\n文墨应经世，林泉漫诱君。\n欲随樵子去，惜与道流分。\n肯谢申公辈，治诗事汉文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}